205
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:56,000
If you want to use software model simulation on this model,

206
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,000
then you need to solve the problem of hole and insertion first.

207
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,000
Then,

208
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:02,000
insert the file into Marvelous Designer again.

