00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Boob water washing effect

210
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Before this,

211
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,000
it has been a very complicated process

212
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
to create the boob water washing effect.

213
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
But using our new preset,

214
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:14,000
you can achieve this effect more quickly and more easily.

215
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
If you need to turn on the water washing effect,

216
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:19,000
please select the fabric to apply the effect first.

217
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Then,

218
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,000
under the type selection,

219
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:24,000
switch the fabric from matte to boob.

220
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,000
Using this preset,

221
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,000
you can create many things.

222
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,000
Under the default setting,

223
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
it is set as for water washing,

224
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
but you can choose any water washing type or self-definition.

225
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,000
In this example,

226
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,000
I will choose acid washing.

227
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,000
As you can see,

228
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,000
the water washing effect has been successfully applied.

229
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,000
Now,

230
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,000
we can use some parameters to adjust the result.

231
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,000
The first one is acid concentration.

232
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:48,000
This is the only setting that changes according to the water washing type.

233
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:52,000
It controls the strength or opacity of the water washing sticker.

234
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,000
You can also adjust the mixing mode.

235
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Here, I choose the mixing mode.

236
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:01,000
The absorption will increase the blur or spread effect for the sticker.

237
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:05,000
It mimics the way the water wash is soaked into the plant.

238
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,000
The cycle cycle can increase the brightness of the water wash.

239
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,000
It mimics the effect of a brighter world

240
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:20,000
with a longer water wash cycle.

241
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,000
Finally,

242
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
the boob powder can enhance the wrinkle texture

243
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,000
of the clothes.

244
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,000
You can try these parameters at will

245
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,000
to achieve the appearance you want.

246
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:32,000
Click on the water washing technique water washing pattern.

247
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
You can set the shrink,

248
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,000
rotate,

249
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
and balance of the water wash pattern.

250
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
You can enter specific parameters here

251
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,000
to make adjustments.

252
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,000
As mentioned above,

253
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:50,000
if you switch to a different water washing type,

254
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:53,000
you will see that the acid concentration has become another setting.

255
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
Their function is similar.

256
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
